	(33652,2,'2017-04-10 22:31:27','2017-04-10 22:31:27','[wpurp-searchable-recipe]Water with Lemon - Recipe Insertion Test - This is the best water with lemon ever. Note: featured image selected in Recipe post, but not alternate image selected in recipe post, and no featured image selected in regular post that this is inserted into.  - water (cold, sparkling), lemon, Squeeze the lemon into the cold sparkling water.; Watch the bubbles rise to the surface for 3 hours.; Drink the now warm, non-sparkling lemon water.;  - This is a recipe note. It has &lt;em&gt;italic text&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;bold text&lt;/strong&gt;, and a &lt;a href=&quot;http://google.com&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n 	&lt;li&gt;It also has a bullet point!&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;ol&gt;\r\n 	&lt;li&gt;And a numbered list.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n 	&lt;li&gt;With two items!&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;[/wpurp-searchable-recipe]','Recipe insertion test - no content in body','This is a custom excerpt for this recipe for warm, non-sparkling lemon water.','publish','open','closed','','recipe-insertion-test-no-content-in-body','','','2017-04-10 22:31:27','2017-04-10 22:31:27','',0,'http://tasty.handbuilt.co/?post_type=recipe&#038;p=33652',0,'recipe','',0),
	(33659,2,'2017-04-10 22:44:56','2017-04-10 22:44:56','Here is some content in the body of the recipe post.[wpurp-searchable-recipe]Recipe insertion test - with content in body -  - olive oil, apple, Do something.;  - Recipe note[/wpurp-searchable-recipe]','Recipe insertion test - with content in body','','publish','open','closed','','recipe-insertion-test-with-content-in-body','','','2017-04-10 22:55:39','2017-04-10 22:55:39','',0,'http://tasty.handbuilt.co/?post_type=recipe&#038;p=33659',0,'recipe','',0);
